# Dependency Chain Updates
RULE: When creating/updating a library, update ALL dependent repos. Tier 0 changes cascade to Tier 1, Tier 2, and services. Tier 1 changes cascade to Tier 2 and services. Tier 2 changes cascade to services.
WHY: Prevents version drift and ensures all repos use latest library versions.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/service-setup-checklist.md, 05-infrastructure/library-setup-checklist.md, 05-infrastructure/new-repo-setup.md
DO: Update pyproject.toml in dependent repos; run uv lock; run quality gates; commit with "feat: update <lib> to vX.Y.Z"
NEVER: Update library without updating dependents; skip dependency chain; leave repos on old versions
